; H.264 six-tap interpolation compute probe for VU0/VU1.
; Input qwords 0..95: six tap planes, 16 groups x 4 lanes.
; Input qwords 96..101: coefficient vectors (1,-5,20,20,-5,1).
; Output qwords 102..117: 16 groups x 4 lanes.
